{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "articleId": "ef5fd4b5bd1c",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-18T13:08:34Z",
  "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod-inference-gateway/",
  "sourceTitle": "Introducing Amazon SageMaker HyperPod Inference Gateway",
  "sourceBodyHash": "a7bdb9e1bf2f28789544735f1a9c037bcdb67001264a02a9357b0f6bdc09d52a",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-26T09:58:29.062891Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-03T05:39:17.407395Z",
  "totalBlocks": 87,
  "translatedBlocks": 87,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8569ebb44525254c",
      "translationZh": "消除 GPU 浪费。将首 token 延迟降低高达 82%。安装一个 Kubernetes 原生插件，零应用更改。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0ca51af0a23741e3",
      "translationZh": "问题：天真的路由会浪费您最昂贵的资源",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32c3e18e76b18b82",
      "translationZh": "在 GPU 集群上大规模运行大型语言模型（LLM）成本高昂。默认的 Kubernetes 负载均衡器使情况更糟。轮询和最少连接算法无法看到 GPU 内部发生的事情：哪些 pod 的 KV 缓存已饱和，哪些正在进行长上下文生成的中途，或者哪些已经在内存中加载了您请求所需的 LoRA 适配器。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e683ee31bd21fd3b",
      "translationZh": "结果？轮询路由导致请求堆积在繁忙的 pod 后面，而空闲容量仍未被使用。在流量突发期间，首 token 延迟飙升至 4+ 秒。GPU 利用率变得不均匀且不可预测。您会过度配置以补偿。这会在没有做有用工作的 GPU 上浪费金钱。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ec632f41f4ec43b1",
      "translationZh": "解决方案：SageMaker HyperPod 推理网关",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d31a34dc222bb39e",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们很高兴宣布 Amazon SageMaker HyperPod 推理网关。它是一个 Kubernetes 原生、GPU 感知的路由系统，作为单个 EKS 托管插件部署在您现有的 HyperPod 基础设施上。它利用实时 GPU 信号将每个推理请求放置到最合适的 pod，从而在不更改模型服务器或客户端应用的情况下降低延迟。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "279d0b64a6da56b4",
      "translationZh": "“等待首 token 4.4 秒的聊天机器人用户现在可以在低于 800 毫秒内看到它。”",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a5dc97a599443318",
      "translationZh": "工作原理：两层架构",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d93bc08cdf7d45a",
      "translationZh": "推理网关采用完全基于 Kubernetes 原生原语的两层设计。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1f186514e62b64c",
      "translationZh": "图 1：推理网关的两层架构",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "54e8b80855aea6d0",
      "translationZh": "第一层 — — 每集群网关（EKS 托管插件）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eab908d2b74656b6",
      "translationZh": "第一层直接作为 amazon-sagemaker-hyperpod-inference 插件安装在每个 HyperPod/EKS 集群上。它由三个核心组件组成，全部基于开源的 Gateway API Inference Extension 构建：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21d8c0694ec491c",
      "translationZh": "高性能 L7 代理，终止传入的 HTTPS 流量，并为每个集群暴露一个私有端点。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "075c45703be3e6ca",
      "translationZh": "2. 基于请求体的路由器（BBR）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "643a7629d1b8b05f",
      "translationZh": "检查每个传入的 OpenAI 兼容请求体，提取 model 字段，并将其路由到正确的模型池。支持多模型路由：一个网关，多个模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7d61bd4050e3ca62",
      "translationZh": "3. 端点选择器（EPP）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3bd41f57862aa6e",
      "translationZh": "智能层。EPP 从每个模型服务 Pod 消费实时 Prometheus 指标，并使用加权评分算法选择最合适的后端：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dbd5d0606381583f",
      "translationZh": "KV 缓存利用率 — 避免选择键值内存几乎已满的 Pod。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "28f6a73706816175",
      "translationZh": "队列深度 — 避免选择请求积压深的 Pod。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4c08c6ac945252d7",
      "translationZh": "LoRA 适配器驻留 — 优先选择已加载所请求适配器的 Pod。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2d1317033a9200a0",
      "translationZh": "前缀缓存命中率 — 优先选择可能从缓存的提示前缀中提供服务的 Pod。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8634650abdaf1e1d",
      "translationZh": "运行中的请求 — 在整个机群中平衡活跃工作负载。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2a92ed957e048ed",
      "translationZh": "每个评分器都带有可配置的权重，因此您可以根据特定工作负载（延迟敏感型聊天相比吞吐量优化型批处理）调整路由行为。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9f4fa7b238e78b8a",
      "translationZh": "第 2 层 — 全局推理路由器（GIR）（即将推出）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e07a8146f49f506",
      "translationZh": "第二层增加了跨多个集群和地区的全局协调，包含跨集群故障转移、全局速率限制和成本感知的流量塑造。第二层建立在第一层之上。每个集群的 per-cluster 网关继续处理本地智能路由。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8fa410826a2afe1e",
      "translationZh": "5 分钟快速入门",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5182105005de779",
      "translationZh": "Inference Gateway 通过单个插件安装和一个声明的 InferenceGatewayConfig 自定义资源进行部署。无需 sidecars，无需 service mesh，无需更改应用代码。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "730fda0923d24700",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：安装插件",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fb2a60792cc02146",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：为您的模型 pod 添加标签",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dceb454c05bbf1cf",
      "translationZh": "为您现有的模型服务器部署添加标签，以便网关能够发现它们：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "41ba51dbd7dee4af",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：应用网关配置",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e69b6c31ff11cd9",
      "translationZh": "创建一个定义您的模型和路由行为的单一 InferenceGatewayConfig 资源：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b47a929eccec626c",
      "translationZh": "步骤 4：发送推理请求",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3f6aab313989160",
      "translationZh": "网关公开一个标准的 OpenAI 兼容端点。您现有的客户端代码无需更改：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2df4ed5a95500d8",
      "translationZh": "就这样。无需 SDK 更改。无需对推理流量进行 SigV4 签名。使用标准 HTTP 及 OpenAI 兼容的模式。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9f8e6f3e0b071e3",
      "translationZh": "在同一集群上运行多个模型？Body-Based Router 原生处理。在您的配置中定义多个调度器，网关将根据请求体中的 model 字段自动将每个请求路由到正确的模型池。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b3e13092d404909",
      "translationZh": "一个网关。多个模型。您的应用中无需路由逻辑。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16f2b70c334bac36",
      "translationZh": "在共享基础模型上服务微调的 LoRA 适配器？推理网关将适配器请求路由到已在 GPU 内存中加载适配器的 pod。这消除了昂贵的适配器切换延迟。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25b4322d37391423",
      "translationZh": "EPP 的 LoRA 亲和力评分器识别哪些 pod 已驻留请求的适配器并相应路由。如果没有 pod 加载了它，请求将发送到可用容量最多的 pod 以快速加载。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1373af8007cc1dec",
      "translationZh": "优雅故障和自愈",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd826d82c57dc5bc",
      "translationZh": "网关在每一层都能优雅降级:",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b20f61aeb85d473",
      "translationZh": "EPP 排除指标过时的 Pod，并将流量路由到健康的 Pod。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "395799479debb615",
      "translationZh": "指标恢复时自动生效。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e21de19dc83f97a",
      "translationZh": "返回 HTTP 429 并带有 Retry-After 头。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "604518d581783ea9",
      "translationZh": "自动扩容添加容量。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f458c17502341d20",
      "translationZh": "GIR 检测到心跳过时，并在 35 秒内将流量重定向。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f48da6b8722ca3ea",
      "translationZh": "重新引入时逐步增加流量。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5689f4f2efbbc48",
      "translationZh": "跨区域路由会自动激活。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec0b7ea151b792c4",
      "translationZh": "延迟更高，对可用性无影响",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4e266fe0ab488902",
      "translationZh": "内置可观测性",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f73db947302c6099",
      "translationZh": "网关在每一层发出指标，全部通过您现有的监控栈暴露：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cbe99e3c4c0dbe9e",
      "translationZh": "Pod 级别 — KV 缓存利用率、队列深度、运行中的请求、适配器驻留（Prometheus）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba5edc4c840ad642",
      "translationZh": "池 级别 — 请求总数、持续时间直方图、令牌计数（Prometheus/Grafana）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7f0f6e002fbf6240",
      "translationZh": "集群 级别 — 平均 KV 缓存、错误率、P99 延迟（Amazon CloudWatch）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d9b41defe276cab8",
      "translationZh": "舰队 级别 — 路由决策、故障转移事件、速率限制命中（CloudWatch）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "448f78ddb559df37",
      "translationZh": "使用默认 Kubernetes 路由，您会损失多少性能？为了找出答案，我们对参数规模从 8B 到 235B 的四种模型进行了基准测试，部署在 p5.48xlarge (H100) 和 g5 (A10G) 实例上。所有流量均通过内部 Application Load Balancer 路由，与生产请求的确切路径相匹配。专用客户端节点组产生受控负载，而模型服务器在独立的服务器节点组上隔离运行，确保在高并发情况下没有资源竞争。以下所有结果均使用网关的默认路由配置，无需任何调优。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b59a887a56375eb6",
      "translationZh": "GPU感知路由在轮询最困难的地方带来最大收益。我们在四种模型（8B到235B参数）上测试了三个真实场景。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3aebd04b569136c3",
      "translationZh": "混合 GPU 世代",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b3d36b4557ff2f1",
      "translationZh": "在生产环境中，GPU 队列很少是均匀的。当较小内存的实例在其更大同伴能够轻松处理的流量下饱和时，轮询会继续将请求发送到过载的 pod。Inference Gateway 能够实时检测到这种不平衡。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c5acc609bece90e",
      "translationZh": "图 2：混合 GPU 世代，轮询基线与 Inference Gateway 的对比",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d71ea54a9044578",
      "translationZh": "突发需求是大多数 LLM 工作负载的常态。单个副本在过载和空闲之间循环，产生轮询无法平滑的延迟尖峰。网关通过将请求导向具有可用容量的 pod 来吸收这些突发。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b47d7e2d022e721",
      "translationZh": "图 3：突发流量，轮询基线与 Inference Gateway 的对比",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c0373291a1495311",
      "translationZh": "共享提示前缀",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2643d909318aecc7",
      "translationZh": "多轮对话和文档问答等工作负载在请求之间共享一个公共的提示前缀。网关的 Prefix Cache Hit Rate 评分器将这些请求路由到已经缓存了该前缀的 pod，从而避免冗余计算。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f70eee16eea771b",
      "translationZh": "图 4：Shared prompt prefixes，round-robin baseline 与 Inference Gateway 的比较",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d010d1fd99d42d48",
      "translationZh": "在所有三种场景中，模式保持一致：您的舰队越偏离均匀，收益越大。在完全均匀的舰队在稳定流量下，副本保持近乎相同的利用率，网关的表现与轮询相当。这使得智能路由在生产流量实际创造的条件下最有价值：混合硬件、突发需求和共享提示前缘。您可以直接启用它，无需先进行手动调优。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5084c230d99dffb0",
      "translationZh": "性能改进摘要",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0abfbb112862514",
      "translationZh": "所有数字均以相同模型副本上的 Kubernetes 轮询基线为参照进行测量，使用网关的默认路由配置。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2b572188674d5c",
      "translationZh": "混合 GPU 代际（Llama-3.1-8B）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe3c34dd02f3c6e7",
      "translationZh": "混合 GPU 代际（Qwen3-32B）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae5f6cf140184821",
      "translationZh": "突发流量（Llama-3.1-70B）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0337d18e331a759e",
      "translationZh": "突发流量（Qwen3-235B）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7dd7b7f4d12555e",
      "translationZh": "共享提示前缀（Llama-3.1-8B）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5bdb245b2d738ea7",
      "translationZh": "统一机群，稳定流量（Qwen3-235B）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae7dabee3d927308",
      "translationZh": "“可比”表示差异落在运行间方差范围内。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "abfe80f33c838f8b",
      "translationZh": "为什么 Kubernetes-native 很重要",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f88744ed9bcd6658",
      "translationZh": "Inference Gateway 不是你在 Kubernetes 旁边部署的独立平台。它就是 Kubernetes：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a9b5e455b27eb681",
      "translationZh": "符合 Gateway API —— 基于官方 Kubernetes Gateway API 及其 Inference Extension 构建。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dfc59dbc2f2dbcd3",
      "translationZh": "声明式配置 —— 一个 CRD（InferenceGatewayConfig）定义了你的完整路由拓扑。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3d3c7fbe646c22ff",
      "translationZh": "无锁定 —— 可与任何 OpenAI 兼容的模型服务器一起工作（vLLM、SGLang、TGI 等）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e9f90d7d3f14a2f0",
      "translationZh": "现有工具 — kubectl、GitOps、Helm、ArgoCD — 均可正常工作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aaf08a46c896a6a3",
      "translationZh": "EKS 插件生命周期 — 可通过 aws eks CLI 或控制台进行安装、升级和回滚。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "955e6983b7f9449d",
      "translationZh": "SageMaker HyperPod 推理网关（Tier 1，按集群路由）今日在提供推理插件的区域中可用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5bff5c79f1485118",
      "translationZh": "Tier 2：全球推理路由器（GIR） — 通过集中式舰队网关实现跨集群、跨区域的智能路由，具备全局速率限制和基于成本层级的流量塑形。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0f92b786c41fd346",
      "translationZh": "金丝雀流量分割 — 使用 InferenceModelRewrite CRDs 将一定比例的流量路由到新模型版本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "05d24fe2a0faf88c",
      "translationZh": "流量控制与优先级带 — 将请求划分为关键、标准或可丢弃，并按带实施准入控制。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4e229f7ebb7c658",
      "translationZh": "准备好停止在 naive 路由上浪费 GPU 容量了吗？安装推理网关插件，几分钟内即可看到首 token 延迟的改善，而不必等待数周。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
